---
/** The commitment level of a catalogue inquiry, shared across entry points. */
---
<div class="inquiry-notice">
  <p><strong>Choose a sauna. Start with a free inquiry.</strong></p>
  <p>No payment or order commitment. We check availability, configuration, project pricing and estimated delivery timing before you decide.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .inquiry-notice { border-left: 2px solid var(--bronze); padding-left: 1rem; margin: 1.4rem 0; max-width: 44rem; }
  .inquiry-notice p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--t-small); line-height: 1.65; }
  .inquiry-notice p + p { margin-top: 0.35rem; }
  .inquiry-notice strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
